--- !u!1001 &9404326
PrefabInstance:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  serializedVersion: 2
  m_Modification:
    serializedVersion: 3
    m_TransformParent: {fileID: 0}
    m_Modifications:
    - target: {fileID: 3075953599242698785, guid: dcf9e22b5051bb645a8306f76a006eb8, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueSteps.Array.size
      value: 3
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3075953599242698785, guid: dcf9e22b5051bb645a8306f76a006eb8, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueSteps.Array.data[0].dialogueLines.Array.size
      value: 7
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3075953599242698785, guid: dcf9e22b5051bb645a8306f76a006eb8, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueSteps.Array.data[1].dialogueLines.Array.size
      value: 8
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3075953599242698785, guid: dcf9e22b5051bb645a8306f76a006eb8, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueSteps.Array.data[2].dialogueLines.Array.size
      value: 13
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3075953599242698785, guid: dcf9e22b5051bb645a8306f76a006eb8, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueSteps.Array.data[3].dialogueLines.Array.size
      value: 5
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3075953599242698785, guid: dcf9e22b5051bb645a8306f76a006eb8, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueSteps.Array.data[0].dialogueLines.Array.data[0].sentence
      value: Calm down dude...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3075953599242698785, guid: dcf9e22b5051bb645a8306f76a006eb8, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueSteps.Array.data[0].dialogueLines.Array.data[1].sentence
      value: So the main thing you'll be doing out there is stocking the shelves.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3075953599242698785, guid: dcf9e22b5051bb645a8306f76a006eb8, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueSteps.Array.data[0].dialogueLines.Array.data[2].sentence
      value: Over there on the table is my punch card...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3075953599242698785, guid: dcf9e22b5051bb645a8306f76a006eb8, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueSteps.Array.data[0].dialogueLines.Array.data[3].sentence
      value: Picking it up will come naturally to you.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3075953599242698785, guid: dcf9e22b5051bb645a8306f76a006eb8, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueSteps.Array.data[0].dialogueLines.Array.data[4].sentence
      value: Once you've picked it up, take it over to the punch card machine.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3075953599242698785, guid: dcf9e22b5051bb645a8306f76a006eb8, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueSteps.Array.data[0].dialogueLines.Array.data[5].sentence
      value: Place it down the exact same way you picked it up.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3075953599242698785, guid: dcf9e22b5051bb645a8306f76a006eb8, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueSteps.Array.data[0].dialogueLines.Array.data[6].sentence
      value: Come back and speak to me once you're done.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3075953599242698785, guid: dcf9e22b5051bb645a8306f76a006eb8, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueSteps.Array.data[0].dialogueLines.Array.data[7].sentence
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3075953599242698785, guid: dcf9e22b5051bb645a8306f76a006eb8, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueSteps.Array.data[1].dialogueLines.Array.data[0].sentence
      value: Okay, I did it...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3075953599242698785, guid: dcf9e22b5051bb645a8306f76a006eb8, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueSteps.Array.data[1].dialogueLines.Array.data[1].sentence
      value: These muffins are way too strong.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3075953599242698785, guid: dcf9e22b5051bb645a8306f76a006eb8, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueSteps.Array.data[1].dialogueLines.Array.data[2].sentence
      value: It feels like someone is controlling me.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3075953599242698785, guid: dcf9e22b5051bb645a8306f76a006eb8, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueSteps.Array.data[1].dialogueLines.Array.data[3].sentence
      value: They have that effect. Now lock in dude.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3075953599242698785, guid: dcf9e22b5051bb645a8306f76a006eb8, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueSteps.Array.data[1].dialogueLines.Array.data[4].sentence
      value: Go over to that egg stack over there and pick up some eggs.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3075953599242698785, guid: dcf9e22b5051bb645a8306f76a006eb8, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueSteps.Array.data[1].dialogueLines.Array.data[5].sentence
      value: Once again it will come naturally to you.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3075953599242698785, guid: dcf9e22b5051bb645a8306f76a006eb8, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueSteps.Array.data[1].dialogueLines.Array.data[6].sentence
      value: Throw some eggs at the picture of the boss.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3075953599242698785, guid: dcf9e22b5051bb645a8306f76a006eb8, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueSteps.Array.data[1].dialogueLines.Array.data[7].sentence
      value: Come back to me when you're done.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3075953599242698785, guid: dcf9e22b5051bb645a8306f76a006eb8, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueSteps.Array.data[2].dialogueLines.Array.data[0].sentence
      value: I'm done, but why did you make me do that?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3075953599242698785, guid: dcf9e22b5051bb645a8306f76a006eb8, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueSteps.Array.data[2].dialogueLines.Array.data[1].sentence
      value: It's going to get overwhelming out there.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3075953599242698785, guid: dcf9e22b5051bb645a8306f76a006eb8, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueSteps.Array.data[2].dialogueLines.Array.data[2].sentence
      value: If a customer gets in the way of you doing your job...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3075953599242698785, guid: dcf9e22b5051bb645a8306f76a006eb8, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueSteps.Array.data[2].dialogueLines.Array.data[3].sentence
      value: Throw an egg at them.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3075953599242698785, guid: dcf9e22b5051bb645a8306f76a006eb8, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueSteps.Array.data[2].dialogueLines.Array.data[4].sentence
      value: WHAT?!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3075953599242698785, guid: dcf9e22b5051bb645a8306f76a006eb8, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueSteps.Array.data[2].dialogueLines.Array.data[5].sentence
      value: 'You can hold 3 dozen eggs. '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3075953599242698785, guid: dcf9e22b5051bb645a8306f76a006eb8, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueSteps.Array.data[2].dialogueLines.Array.data[6].sentence
      value: '12 in your hand, 24 in your reserves. Make sure you don''t run out. '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3075953599242698785, guid: dcf9e22b5051bb645a8306f76a006eb8, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueSteps.Array.data[2].dialogueLines.Array.data[7].sentence
      value: You're gonna get me fired!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3075953599242698785, guid: dcf9e22b5051bb645a8306f76a006eb8, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueSteps.Array.data[2].dialogueLines.Array.data[8].sentence
      value: That's why you're gonna have to be conservative with it.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3075953599242698785, guid: dcf9e22b5051bb645a8306f76a006eb8, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueSteps.Array.data[2].dialogueLines.Array.data[9].sentence
      value: If you piss enough customers off and they all leave the store...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3075953599242698785, guid: dcf9e22b5051bb645a8306f76a006eb8, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueSteps.Array.data[3].dialogueLines.Array.data[0].sentence
      value: I'm done, but why did you make me do that?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3075953599242698785, guid: dcf9e22b5051bb645a8306f76a006eb8, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueSteps.Array.data[3].dialogueLines.Array.data[1].sentence
      value: It's going to get overwhelming out there.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3075953599242698785, guid: dcf9e22b5051bb645a8306f76a006eb8, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueSteps.Array.data[3].dialogueLines.Array.data[2].sentence
      value: If a customer gets in the way of you doing your job...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3075953599242698785, guid: dcf9e22b5051bb645a8306f76a006eb8, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueSteps.Array.data[3].dialogueLines.Array.data[3].sentence
      value: Throw an egg at them.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3075953599242698785, guid: dcf9e22b5051bb645a8306f76a006eb8, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueSteps.Array.data[3].dialogueLines.Array.data[4].sentence
      value: WHAT?!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3075953599242698785, guid: dcf9e22b5051bb645a8306f76a006eb8, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueSteps.Array.data[2].dialogueLines.Array.data[10].sentence
      value: Who knows what Boss will do...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3075953599242698785, guid: dcf9e22b5051bb645a8306f76a006eb8, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueSteps.Array.data[2].dialogueLines.Array.data[11].sentence
      value: 'Anyway man, I think you''re ready to tackle the shift.  '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3075953599242698785, guid: dcf9e22b5051bb645a8306f76a006eb8, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueSteps.Array.data[2].dialogueLines.Array.data[12].sentence
      value: 'When you''re prepared, leave the breakroom and meet me out there. '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3075953599242698785, guid: dcf9e22b5051bb645a8306f76a006eb8, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueSteps.Array.data[0].dialogueLines.Array.data[0].speakerName
      value: Jerry
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3075953599242698785, guid: dcf9e22b5051bb645a8306f76a006eb8, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueSteps.Array.data[0].dialogueLines.Array.data[1].speakerName
      value: Jerry
